<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Mara's Properties — Realtor Amara, Abuja</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="data:image/jpeg;base64, ?">
<style>
  :root {
    --primary: #0F172A;
    --accent: #CA8A04;
    --accent-light: #FEF08A;
    --bg-light: #F8FAFC;
    --text-dark: #1E293B;
    --text-muted: #64748B;
    --white: #FFFFFF;
    --border: #E2E8F0;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
  }

  body {
    background-color: var(--bg-light);
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  header {
    background-color: var(--primary);
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 1000;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .nav-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .logo img {
    width: 45px;
    height: 45px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--accent);
  }

  nav ul {
    display: flex;
    list-style: none;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  nav a {
    color: var(--white);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }

  nav a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .hero {
    background: linear-gradient(rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600596542815-ffad4c1539a9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80') center/cover;
    color: var(--white);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .hero p {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    color: var(--border);
  }

  .btn {
    background-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--primary);
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: background-color 0.3s;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    background-color: var(--accent-light);
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 4rem auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .section-title h2 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .section-title p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .properties-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .property-card {
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .property-img {
    height: 200px;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
  }

  .property-details {
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .property-price {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .property-title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .property-location {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .about-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--white);
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .about-content h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .about-content p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
  }

  .contact-section {
    background-color: var(--primary);
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-top: 4rem;
  }

  .contact-container {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .form-group {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .form-group label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .form-group input, .form-group textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  footer {
    background-color: var(--primary);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    margin-top: 4rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    nav ul {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="nav-container">
    <div class="logo">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64, " alt="Mara's Properties Logo">
      <span>Mara's Properties</span>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="#properties">Properties</a></li>
        <li><a href="#about">About Amara</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="home" class="hero">
  <h1>Find Your Dream Home in Abuja</h1>
  <p>Luxury apartments, spacious villas, and prime land listings with Realtor Amara.</p>
  <a href="#properties" class="btn">Explore Listings</a>
</section>

<div class="container">
  <section id="properties">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Featured Properties</h2>
      <p>Handpicked premium real estate across Abuja</p>
    </div>
    <div class="properties-grid">
      <div class="property-card">
        <div class="property-img" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80');"></div>
        <div class="property-details">
          <div class="property-price">₦250,000,000</div>
          <div class="property-title">5 Bedroom Fully Detached Duplex</div>
          <div class="property-location">Maitama, Abuja</div>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn">Inquire Now</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="property-card">
        <div class="property-img" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512917774080-9991f1c4c750?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80');"></div>
        <div class="property-details">
          <div class="property-price">₦85,000,000</div>
          <div class="property-title">3 Bedroom Luxury Apartment</div>
          <div class="property-location">Jabi, Abuja</div>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn">Inquire Now</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="property-card">
        <div class="property-img" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80');"></div>
        <div class="property-details">
          <div class="property-price">₦180,000,000</div>
          <div class="property-title">4 Bedroom Terrace + BQ</div>
          <div class="property-location">Katampe Extension, Abuja</div>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn">Inquire Now</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about" style="margin-top: 5rem;">
    <div class="about-section">
      <div>
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Amara - Realtor in Abuja" style="width: 100%; border-radius: 8px;">
      </div>
      <div class="about-content">
        <h2>Meet Amara</h2>
        <p>With years of experience navigating the vibrant real estate market in Abuja, I help clients buy, sell, and invest in properties with confidence.</p>
        <p>Whether you're looking for a luxury home in Maitama, a commercial space in Central Business District, or land for development in Katampe, my personalized service guarantees you get the best deal.</p>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn">Get in Touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="contact-section">
    <div class="contact-container">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2 style="color: var(--white);">Contact Realtor Amara</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--border);">Ready to find your next property? Send a message today!</p>
      </div>
      <form onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Thank you for reaching out! Amara will contact you shortly.');">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="name">Your Name</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" required placeholder="John Doe">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="email">Email Address</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" required placeholder="john@example.com">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="phone">Phone Number</label>
          <input type="tel" id="phone" required placeholder="+234 800 000 0000">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="message">Message</label>
          <textarea id="message" rows="4" required placeholder="I am interested in..."></textarea>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn" style="width: 100%;">Send Message</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<footer>
  <p>&copy; 2026 Mara's Properties. Realtor Amara, Abuja. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
